    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37040" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεγγῠ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>give up</i> a slave <i>on security</i> to be
			examined, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.47
			</span></i>; <i>free</i> one <i>by giving bail for</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.73
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be bailed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεγγυηθέντες κριθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.44
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.169
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ οἷς ἐξηγγυήθη</span> [to
			fulfil the conditions] on which <i>security was given,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				23.10
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
